    "body": "## Background\n\nRevert https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/pull/7859 in full, as requested.\n\n## What changed\n\nReverts commit `b4407209223d290bbf7d6f2167d4e2ae51b7a58d`, restoring both `pyproject.toml` and `uv.lock` to their pre-#7859 contents.\n\n## Details\n\n- Restore `opentelemetry-api~=1.33.1` in the dev and LTS groups.\n- Restore the previous setuptools constraints and remove the ModelOpt minimum added by #7859.\n- Undo the full dependency lockfile upgrade included in #7859.\n\nThis restores the previous OpenTelemetry constraint, including the incompatibility with newer wandb versions described in #7859.\n\n## Tested\n\n- `git diff --cached --check` — passed before committing.\n- `git diff --exit-code b4407209223d290bbf7d6f2167d4e2ae51b7a58d^ -- pyproject.toml uv.lock` — passed; both files exactly match the pre-#7859 versions.\n- `docker run --rm -v /home/okoenig/Documents/Repositories/github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM-codex-worktrees/revert-pr-7859:/workspace -w /workspace gitlab-master.nvidia.com/adlr/megatron-lm/mcore_ci_dev:70313323-amd64 uv lock --check --offline` — passed; resolved 328 packages.\n",
    "changed_files": 2,
